<title>USA: AT&amp;T says final arbitration decision near.</title>
<headline>AT&amp;T says final arbitration decision near.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>AT&amp;T Corp said hearing examiners of the Illinois Commerce Commission on Thursday issued a proposed arbitration decision outlining prices, terms and conditions under which AT&amp;T will interconnect with Ameritech Corp's network to provide local phone service in the state.</p>
<p>A final arbitration decision is expected from the Illinois Commerce Commission by November 22.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
